		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Protean clerics, emissaries of the Maelstrom Gods. Emerald green serpent with gold-hued plumage and a third eye in its brow.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 13, <strong>HP</strong> 39, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 bite +3 (2d6) and gaze, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly, swim), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +3, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +3, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 8</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Being of Chaos</strong>. Only damaged by silver or magical sources. Immune to acid.</p><p></p><p><strong>Gaze</strong>. One target within near, CHA 15+ or 1d4 WIS damage, insane at 0 WIS.</p><p></p><p><strong>Whispers</strong>. Near-sized aura of maddening whispers centered on protean. Mortals within WIS 15+ on turn. On failure, confused and unable to take action or move.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
